#: ../../upstream/docs/user/environment-variables.rst:4
msgid "Environment variable overview"
msgstr "环境变量概览"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/environment-variables.rst:6
msgid ""
"Read the Docs allows you to define your own environment variables to be used"
" in the build process. It also defines a set of :doc:`default environment "
"variables </reference/environment-variables>` with information about your "
"build. These are useful for different purposes:"
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 允许你定义自己的环境变量用于构建过程。它还定义了一组 :doc:`默认环境变量 </reference"
"/environment-variables>`，包含关于你构建的信息。这些变量有不同的用途："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/environment-variables.rst:10
msgid ""
"Custom environment variables are useful for adding build secrets such as API"
" tokens."
msgstr "自定义环境变量可用于添加构建机密，如 API 令牌。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/environment-variables.rst:11
msgid ""
"Default environment variables are useful for varying your build specifically"
" for Read the Docs or specific types of builds on Read the Docs."
msgstr "默认环境变量可用于专门针对 Read the Docs 或 Read the Docs 上特定类型的构建进行变更。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/environment-variables.rst:19
msgid ""
"Custom environment variables are defined in your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Environment variables`. Environment variables "
"are defined for a project's entire build process, :ref:`with 2 important "
"exceptions <custom_env_var_exceptions>`."
msgstr ""
"自定义环境变量在项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Environment variables` "
"中定义。环境变量针对项目的整个构建过程定义，:ref:`有 2 个重要例外 <custom_env_var_exceptions>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/environment-variables.rst:23
msgid ""
"Aside from storing secrets, there are :ref:`other patterns <environment-"
"variables:Patterns of using environment variables>` that take advantage of "
"environment variables, like reusing the same *monorepo* configuration in "
"multiple documentation projects. In cases where the environment variable "
"isn't a secret, like a build tool flag, you should also be aware of the "
":ref:`alternatives to environment variables <environment-"
"variables:Alternatives to environment variables>`."
msgstr ""
"除了存储机密，还有 :ref:`其他模式 <environment-variables:Patterns of using environment "
"variables>` 利用环境变量，例如在多个文档项目中复用相同的 *monorepo* "
"配置。在环境变量不是机密的情况下（如构建工具标志），你也应了解 :ref:`环境变量的替代方案 <environment-"
"variables:Alternatives to environment variables>`。"

